  "details": "(This is side effect of a known issue for the dev. I write for the record.)\nReproduce steps:\n1. Open UdonGraphWindow. Dock to anywhere SceneView is not docked.\n2. Open Graph program asset by clicking the button that is located UdonBehaviour inspector.\n3. Then UdonGraphWindow moves to where SceneView is.\n* It's same by the button in Welcome window.\n* If SceneView isn't shown, UdonGraphWindow pops up.\n* version: VRCSDK-UDON-2020.06.04.14.15_Closed_Community_Test\n---- Details\nI checked the code and found it closes the window and opens again. so this happens. And there's \"TODO\" note.",
